      "issues": [
        "- In Rule 1 prefix table, the example \"गति → दुर्गति\" for उपसर्ग \"दुर-/दु-\" is not an antonym pair; \"दुर्गति\" means misfortune/bad condition, not the opposite of \"गति\" (motion/speed). → Replace with a valid antonym example such as \"शील → दुर्शील\" (good character → bad character) or retain only \"सदाचार → दुराचार\".",
        "- In Rule 1 prefix table, the examples \"उत्तर → प्रत्युत्तर\" and \"क्रिया → प्रतिक्रिया\" for उपसर्ग \"प्रति-\" are not antonyms; they denote reply/counter-action, not opposition. → Replace with true antonym pairs formed with \"प्रति-\" such as \"अनुकूल → प्रतिकूल\" (favourable → unfavourable) or \"प्रत्यक्ष → परोक्ष\" (direct → indirect)."
      ],
